From beb4d4c6b89ec273566251051675f6e8f49fd7a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starbite <starbite@local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:13:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0431-starbite-m11b-ionetworkingfamily.patch - Apple's
 IONetworkingFamily-188 built into the STARLTE kernel (unmodified copy under
 iokit/Families/IONetworkingFamily with its include layout, from
 starbite/apple-families at 2fc456d; 12 STARLTE-only build units that include
 iokit/Families/kext-view.h and define __PRIVATE_SPI__ like the kext target;
 include paths incl. bsd/ last for net/classq/classq.h; the IONetworkStack and
 IOKDP personalities): IONetworkController, IOEthernetController/Interface and
 IONetworkStack for StarbiteUSBNCM (M11b). IONetworkStack starts on every boot
 of this kernel, so it is held in series-12377-pending (on 0428-0430)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
